{"seq":2,"slug":"field-experiments-rct","title":"实地实验与 RCT：行为干预评估的黄金标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/methodology/field-experiments-rct","wordCount":2464,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"实地实验与-rct-行为干预评估的黄金标准\">实地实验与 RCT：行为干预评估的黄金标准</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>RCT</strong> 通过随机分配处理消除选择偏差，使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≈</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATE = E[Y_1 - Y_0] \\approx \\bar{Y}_T - \\bar{Y}_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 成为无偏估计。三种随机化策略：<strong>完全随机化</strong>（简单直接，小样本可能不平衡）、<strong>分层随机化</strong>（在关键协变量层内随机，提升精度）、<strong>聚类随机化</strong>（群体层面干预时使用，需设计效应 DEFF 校正）。当随机化不可行时，**差分中差（DID）**利用平行趋势假设进行准实验推断。**多臂老虎机（MAB）**在需要快速优化指标时替代传统 A/B 测试。</p>\n<p>随机对照实验（Randomized Controlled Trial，RCT）是评估行为干预效果的黄金标准。它通过随机分配将系统性偏差最小化，使因果推断成为可能。本文介绍行为经济学领域的 RCT 设计策略、A/B 测试方法、差分中差分析，以及如何判断实验结果的内外部效度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要随机化\">为什么需要随机化</h2><h3 id=\"选择偏差的问题\">选择偏差的问题</h3><p>观察性研究的核心问题是<strong>选择偏差</strong>（Selection Bias）：参与某行为的人与不参与的人在其他特征上可能系统性地不同，使得直接比较两组无法得出因果结论。</p>\n<p><strong>典型案例</strong>：</p>\n<p>观察到&quot;参与健身课程的人比不参与的人更健康&quot;，不能推断&quot;健身课程让人更健康&quot;——因为选择参加健身课程的人可能本来就更注重健康（选择效应）。</p>\n<p><strong>随机分配的解决方案</strong>：</p>\n<p>通过随机分配处理（Treatment Assignment），使处理组和控制组在所有<strong>可观测和不可观测</strong>的特征上在期望值上平衡。这是 RCT 的核心优势。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[随机分配] --&gt; T[处理组 Treatment Group]&#10;    R --&gt; C[控制组 Control Group]&#10;    T --&gt; Y1[结果 Y1]&#10;    C --&gt; Y0[结果 Y0]&#10;    ATE[平均处理效应 ATE] --&gt; R&#10;    R --&gt; B[两组在 Y0 的期望值相同]\">graph TD\n    R[随机分配] --&gt; T[处理组 Treatment Group]\n    R --&gt; C[控制组 Control Group]\n    T --&gt; Y1[结果 Y1]\n    C --&gt; Y0[结果 Y0]\n    ATE[平均处理效应 ATE] --&gt; R\n    R --&gt; B[两组在 Y0 的期望值相同]</pre><p><strong>平均处理效应（ATE）的估算</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≈</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATE = E[Y_1 - Y_0] \\approx \\bar{Y}_T - \\bar{Y}_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在足够大的样本下，随机化保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{Y}_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[Y_0]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的无偏估计（即&quot;如果未被处理，处理组的结果将如何&quot;的合理代理）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"随机化策略\">随机化策略</h2><h3 id=\"完全随机化-simple-randomization\">完全随机化（Simple Randomization）</h3><p>最基本的随机化方式：将每个参与者以固定概率（通常 50%）分配到处理组或控制组，相互独立。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>优点</strong>：简单直接，分析简便</li>\n<li><strong>缺点</strong>：小样本下两组可能在某些特征上不平衡</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"分层随机化-stratified-randomization\">分层随机化（Stratified Randomization）</h3><p>在已知的重要协变量（如性别、年龄、地区）的层内分别随机化，确保两组在这些维度上平衡。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>分层变量</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>储蓄实验</td>\n<td>当前储蓄率、收入水平</td>\n<td>基础储蓄率影响干预效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>健康实验</td>\n<td>年龄、基础健康状况</td>\n<td>不同年龄对健康干预响应不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>教育实验</td>\n<td>原始成绩、学校</td>\n<td>学校层面差异大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>**配对随机化（Matched-Pair）**是分层随机化的极端情形：将参与者按相似特征两两配对，再在每对内随机分配处理。这在小样本实验中特别有用，能显著提高统计功效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"聚类随机化-cluster-randomization\">聚类随机化（Cluster Randomization）</h3><p>当干预在群体层面进行（如对一个村庄、一所学校、一个公司实施干预），单独随机化个体在技术上不可行时，使用聚类随机化：以群体（cluster）为单位进行随机分配。</p>\n<p><strong>典型场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>学校营养午餐实验：以学校为单位随机分配（不能同一学校半数学生吃健康午餐，半数不吃）</li>\n<li>村庄级助推实验：以村庄为单位</li>\n<li>企业内部实验：以部门为单位</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>代价</strong>：聚类随机化的有效样本量远小于个体样本量，需要大幅增加参与群体数量。</p>\n<p>**设计效应（Design Effect，DEFF）**量化了聚类化造成的效率损失：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DEFF = 1 + (m-1) \\times ICC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是每个 cluster 的平均大小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ICC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是组内相关系数（intra-cluster correlation）。ICC 高意味着同一 cluster 内个体高度相似，有效信息少。</p>\n<h2 id=\"a-b-测试-产品环境中的行为实验\">A/B 测试：产品环境中的行为实验</h2><h3 id=\"a-b-测试的基本逻辑\">A/B 测试的基本逻辑</h3><p>A/B 测试（也称为分裂测试，Split Testing）是互联网产品中最常用的实验形式，本质上是一个随机对照实验：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    U[用户流量] --&gt; V1[A版本 控制组]&#10;    U --&gt; V2[B版本 实验组]&#10;    V1 --&gt; MA[指标A组]&#10;    V2 --&gt; MB[指标B组]&#10;    MA --&gt; S[统计检验]&#10;    MB --&gt; S\">graph LR\n    U[用户流量] --&gt; V1[A版本 控制组]\n    U --&gt; V2[B版本 实验组]\n    V1 --&gt; MA[指标A组]\n    V2 --&gt; MB[指标B组]\n    MA --&gt; S[统计检验]\n    MB --&gt; S</pre><p><strong>A/B 测试的标准流程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>提出假说</strong>：新版本将使指标 X 提升 Y%</li>\n<li><strong>计算样本量</strong>：基于预期效应量、功效、显著性水平</li>\n<li><strong>运行实验</strong>：随机分配流量，双组同时运行（避免时间效应）</li>\n<li><strong>收集数据</strong>：达到预计样本量后分析（不要中途频繁查看）</li>\n<li><strong>统计分析</strong>：双样本 t 检验、z 检验或卡方检验（取决于指标类型）</li>\n<li><strong>做出决策</strong>：基于统计显著性 + 效应量 + 置信区间</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"多臂实验-multi-armed-bandit\">多臂实验（Multi-Armed Bandit）</h3><p>传统 A/B 测试的问题：在实验期间，明显较差的方案仍获得 50% 流量，造成机会损失。</p>\n<p><strong>多臂老虎机（Multi-Armed Bandit，MAB）</strong>：动态分配流量，逐步将更多流量导向表现更好的方案，平衡探索（Exploration）和利用（Exploitation）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>权衡</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传统 A/B 测试</td>\n<td>需要严格统计推断</td>\n<td>效率低，机会损本大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Epsilon-Greedy MAB</td>\n<td>快速优化指标</td>\n<td>统计推断不严格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Thompson Sampling</td>\n<td>贝叶斯框架下的MAB</td>\n<td>计算复杂，统计可解释性好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UCB（上置信界）</td>\n<td>适合非平稳环境</td>\n<td>复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"实验中的常见问题\">实验中的常见问题</h3><p><strong>新奇效应（Novelty Effect）</strong>：用户对新设计的初始热情导致短期指标升高，长期回归正常。解决方案：确保实验期足够长（通常至少 2 周）。</p>\n<p><strong>学习效应（Learning Effect）</strong>：用户逐渐适应干预，效果随时间变化。</p>\n<p><strong>干扰效应（Interference/Spillover）</strong>：处理组和控制组的用户之间存在互动，使控制组受到干预影响（违反 SUTVA，稳定单元处理值假设）。在社交产品实验中尤为常见。</p>\n<p><strong>辛普森悖论（Simpson&#39;s Paradox）</strong>：不分层的总体结论可能与各子组的结论相反，因为子组在两个变量上分布不均衡。应当始终对关键子组进行分层分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差分中差-difference-in-differences-did\">差分中差（Difference-in-Differences，DID）</h2><p>当随机化不可行时，DID 是准实验方法中常用的因果推断工具。它利用&quot;平行趋势假设&quot;来控制时间趋势，识别干预效果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"did-的基本逻辑\">DID 的基本逻辑</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DID = (Y_{T,post} - Y_{T,pre}) - (Y_{C,post} - Y_{C,pre})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[干预前 T组基线] --&gt; B[干预后 T组结果]&#10;    C[干预前 C组基线] --&gt; D[干预后 C组结果]&#10;    B --&gt; E[T组变化]&#10;    D --&gt; F[C组变化 时间趋势代理]&#10;    E --&gt; G[DID估计量 净干预效果]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    A[干预前 T组基线] --&gt; B[干预后 T组结果]\n    C[干预前 C组基线] --&gt; D[干预后 C组结果]\n    B --&gt; E[T组变化]\n    D --&gt; F[C组变化 时间趋势代理]\n    E --&gt; G[DID估计量 净干预效果]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p><strong>平行趋势假设</strong>：如果没有干预，处理组和控制组的结果变量会呈现相同的时间趋势。这是 DID 有效性的核心假设，无法直接检验（因为反事实不可观测），但可以通过检验干预前两组趋势是否平行来间接支撑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"did-的应用案例\">DID 的应用案例</h3><p><strong>最低工资法的就业效应研究</strong>（Card 和 Krueger，1994）：</p>\n<p>新泽西州提高最低工资，而相邻的宾夕法尼亚州没有变化。将宾夕法尼亚作为&quot;控制组&quot;，用 DID 估计最低工资提升对快餐就业的影响。这一经典研究（后来的研究有争议）展示了 DID 如何在政策不可随机化时进行准实验评估。</p>\n<p><strong>政策助推的事后评估</strong>：当助推干预已经实施（无法设计前瞻性 RCT），可以用 DID 利用干预时机和覆盖范围的差异进行事后评估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"元分析与效应量合成\">元分析与效应量合成</h2><p>当同一干预在多个独立研究中被测试，元分析（Meta-Analysis）可以合成证据，提高效应量估计的精度和外部效度。</p>\n<p><strong>行为经济学元分析的主要发现</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>干预类型</th>\n<th>元分析效应量（d）</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认值变化（opt-out vs opt-in）</td>\n<td>d = 0.48（中等）</td>\n<td>Jachimowicz 等，2019</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社会规范信息</td>\n<td>d = 0.17（小）</td>\n<td>Nolan 等，2008</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实施意图</td>\n<td>d = 0.54（中等）</td>\n<td>Gollwitzer &amp; Sheeran，2006</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架效应（损失 vs 收益）</td>\n<td>d = 0.26（小-中）</td>\n<td>Levin 等，1998</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺机制</td>\n<td>d = 0.45（中等）</td>\n<td>Milkman 等，2014</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>元分析的局限</strong>：出版偏误会高估效应量（显著结果更容易发表），漏斗图不对称是出版偏误的信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行为-rct-的实施检查清单\">行为 RCT 的实施检查清单</h2><p>在启动一个行为实验之前，以下问题需要明确回答：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>关键问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>研究问题</td>\n<td>假说是否已预注册？主要结果变量是否预先指定？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机化</td>\n<td>单位是个人还是群体？是否需要分层？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本量</td>\n<td>功效分析是否完成？预计效应量依据是什么？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验期</td>\n<td>是否足够长以避免新奇效应？是否涵盖完整决策周期？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干扰</td>\n<td>SUTVA 是否成立？处理组和控制组是否可能相互影响？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伦理</td>\n<td>参与者是否知情同意？是否存在欺骗？控制组是否处于危害中？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分析</td>\n<td>分析方法是否预注册？如何处理缺失数据和不合规参与？</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实验方法的严谨性是行为经济学政策建议的可信度基础。关于实验中的伦理问题，<a href=\"ethics-and-manipulation\">伦理与操纵边界</a>将做专题讨论。实验设计的前序知识在<a href=\"behavioral-experiment-design\">行为实验设计</a>中已有覆盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>RCT 和 A/B 测试的核心价值在于将因果推断从&quot;合理猜测&quot;变为&quot;统计保证&quot;。实践要点：聚类随机化的设计效应不可忽视（会严重低估所需样本量）；新奇效应导致 A/B 测试需要足够长的观测期；元分析中注意出版偏误对效应量的系统性高估。对大多数政策和产品场景，DID 是 RCT 不可行时的合理替代——但平行趋势假设必须认真对待，不能口头敷衍。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实地实验与 RCT：行为干预评估的黄金标准","id":"实地实验与-rct-行为干预评估的黄金标准"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要随机化","id":"为什么需要随机化"},{"level":3,"text":"选择偏差的问题","id":"选择偏差的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"随机化策略","id":"随机化策略"},{"level":3,"text":"完全随机化（Simple Randomization）","id":"完全随机化-simple-randomization"},{"level":3,"text":"分层随机化（Stratified Randomization）","id":"分层随机化-stratified-randomization"},{"level":3,"text":"聚类随机化（Cluster Randomization）","id":"聚类随机化-cluster-randomization"},{"level":2,"text":"A/B 测试：产品环境中的行为实验","id":"a-b-测试-产品环境中的行为实验"},{"level":3,"text":"A/B 测试的基本逻辑","id":"a-b-测试的基本逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"多臂实验（Multi-Armed Bandit）","id":"多臂实验-multi-armed-bandit"},{"level":3,"text":"实验中的常见问题","id":"实验中的常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"差分中差（Difference-in-Differences，DID）","id":"差分中差-difference-in-differences-did"},{"level":3,"text":"DID 的基本逻辑","id":"did-的基本逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"DID 的应用案例","id":"did-的应用案例"},{"level":2,"text":"元分析与效应量合成","id":"元分析与效应量合成"},{"level":2,"text":"行为 RCT 的实施检查清单","id":"行为-rct-的实施检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"行为实验设计：从问题到可测量假说","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/methodology/behavioral-experiment-design"},"next":{"title":"伦理与操纵边界：助推与 Dark Pattern 的分界线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/methodology/ethics-and-manipulation"}}